{"version":1,"content":"<p>日前 Telegram 團隊向開發者發送新通知，Telegram 本周將繼續主動分析全部機械人和迷你應用的支付活動。任何在 Telegram 內部使用星星 (Stars) 以外方式銷售數字商品或服務的應用，都可能隨時被封號，平台不再提前發佈警告。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586866.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T05:46:25.181410+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T05:37:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T05:39:43.157745+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T05:39:43.157745+00:00","content_hash":"b8f5fe8cbf73c8058a9727593b9791428b6c616d47caacde3149ddb84d533f69","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}